234
00:17:02.520 --> 00:17:08.460
So if I want only to move in the X-axis, you would type G followed by X, and now

235
00:17:08.580 --> 00:17:14.460
I'm constrained to moving only on the X-axis. Okay? Escape to get out of that.

236
00:17:14.911 --> 00:17:18.630
If I want to move on the Y-axis, it's G and Y, and then I move only in the Y.

237
00:17:19.020 --> 00:17:23.640
If I want to move only in the Z-axis, it's G and Z, and then moving up and down

238
00:17:23.700 --> 00:17:26.040
only. Okay? So it's good to have that constraint.

