00:19:01.206 --> 00:19:04.956
X will use the red line as its center of rotation, and

259
00:19:07.206 --> 00:19:10.926
R, Y will use the green line as the center of rotation.

260
00:19:11.676 --> 00:19:17.526
If you do not use any of the modifier keys and you do rotation, the axis

261
00:19:17.586 --> 00:19:22.926
